        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 1970P, Elite Collection High End Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe High End Modern Door Pull can be used in commercial and residential applications. It is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. The Omnia 1970P Elite Collection High End Pull comes in several modern finish color options. Choose from satin brass ,satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze among others.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the High End Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>1970P/305:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>1970P/457:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-high-end-door-pull-set-omnia-btb-1970p\"><b> Omnia 1970P High End Back-To-Back Pull Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
